<main class="page">
<section class="container np-hero"><div class="stack"><p class="eyebrow" data-revel-appear="fade">[[Depuis 2009||Since 2009]]</p><h1 data-revel-text="up split=words">[[Redonnons de la place au vivant.||Let's make room for nature again.]]</h1><p class="lead" data-revel-appear="up delay=0.3">{{ site.description }}</p><div class="actions" data-revel-appear="up delay=0.4"><a class="btn" href="#[[don||donate]]">[[Soutenir l'association||Support us]]</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#[[agir||involved]]">[[Devenir bénévole||Volunteer]]</a></div></div><div class="np-hero__media" data-revel-appear="zoom-in dur=1"><img src="@@hero:1400@@" alt="@@alt:hero@@"></div></section>
<section class="section section--surface" id="mission"><div class="container"><x-use c="section-head" eyebrow="[[Notre mission||Our mission]]" title="[[Des résultats concrets, mesurés chaque année||Concrete results, measured every year]]"></x-use><div class="grid grid--4"><x-use c="stat" value="38 km" label="[[de haies replantées||of hedgerows replanted]]"></x-use><x-use c="stat" value="12" label="[[zones humides protégées||wetlands protected]]"></x-use><x-use c="stat" value="1 400" label="[[bénévoles||volunteers]]"></x-use><x-use c="stat" value="92 %" label="[[des dons sur le terrain||of donations in the field]]"></x-use></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="actions"><div class="container"><x-use c="section-head" eyebrow="[[Actions||Actions]]" title="[[Ce que nous faisons||What we do]]"></x-use><div class="grid grid--3"><x-use c="card" image="@@action1:900@@" title="[[Chantiers de plantation||Planting days]]" link="#[[agir||involved]]" data-revel-appear="up"><p>[[Chaque samedi de novembre à mars.||Every Saturday from November to March.]]</p></x-use><x-use c="card" image="@@action2:900@@" title="[[Sorties nature||Nature walks]]" link="#[[agir||involved]]" data-revel-appear="up delay=0.1"><p>[[Pour les écoles et les familles.||For schools and families.]]</p></x-use><x-use c="card" image="@@action3:900@@" title="[[Suivi des espèces||Species monitoring]]" link="#[[agir||involved]]" data-revel-appear="up delay=0.2"><p>[[Avec des scientifiques bénévoles.||With volunteer scientists.]]</p></x-use></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--tight" id="[[don||donate]]"><div class="container donate"><div class="stack"><p class="eyebrow">[[Faire un don||Donate]]</p><h2>[[Chaque euro plante quelque chose.||Every dollar plants something.]]</h2><p class="lead">[[Votre don est déductible à 66 % de vos impôts. Les liens de paiement se règlent dans Paramètres › Informations du site.||Your donation is tax deductible. Payment links are set in Settings › Site information.]]</p></div><div><div class="donate__amounts"><p class="donate__amount"><strong>[[20 €||$20]]</strong><span>[[5 arbres||5 trees]]</span></p><p class="donate__amount"><strong>[[50 €||$50]]</strong><span>[[10 m de haie||30 ft of hedge]]</span></p><p class="donate__amount"><strong>[[100 €||$100]]</strong><span>[[une mare||a pond]]</span></p></div><div class="donate__buttons"><a class="btn" href="{{ site.donate_stripe }}">[[Donner par carte||Give by card]]</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.donate_paypal }}">[[Donner avec PayPal||Give with PayPal]]</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--surface"><div class="container grid grid--2"><img class="media media--wide" src="@@nature:1200@@" alt="@@alt:nature@@"><x-use c="testimonial" quote="[[J'ai découvert l'association en plantant une haie près de chez moi. Trois ans après, j'y emmène mes voisins.||I found the association by planting a hedge near my home. Three years later, I bring my neighbours.]]" name="Hélène Morel" role="[[Bénévole depuis 2023||Volunteer since 2023]]" avatar="@@saas/avatar1:160@@"></x-use></div></section>
<section class="section" id="[[agir||involved]]"><div class="container"><x-use c="section-head" eyebrow="[[Agir||Get involved]]" title="[[Rejoindre un chantier||Join a planting day]]" text="[[Laissez-nous vos coordonnées, nous vous proposons une date près de chez vous.||Leave your details and we will suggest a date near you.]]"></x-use><form class="form form--narrow" data-revel-form="[[benevoles||volunteers]]"><div class="form__row"><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Nom||Name]]</span><input class="field__input" type="text" name="[[nom||name]]" autocomplete="name" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[E-mail||Email]]</span><input class="field__input" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></label></div><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Ville||Town]]</span><input class="field__input" type="text" name="[[ville||town]]" autocomplete="address-level2"></label><button class="btn" type="submit">[[Je participe||Count me in]]</button><p class="form__status" data-revel-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></section>
<section class="section section--tight partners"><div class="container"><p class="muted partners__label">[[Avec le soutien de||With the support of]]</p><div class="ticker" data-revel-loop="ticker speed=35 fade=96"><span class="ticker__item">Fondation Terre</span><span class="ticker__item">[[Région||Region]]</span><span class="ticker__item">Bio Coop</span><span class="ticker__item">Vallée Verte</span><span class="ticker__item">Eau Claire</span></div></div></section>
</main>
